OL,3,GNEWSACouncil may sell fire-hit site as
OL,4,Apart of #4m sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council in West Yorkshire could sell
OL,7,Fa row of units that was devastated by a
OL,8,Fsuspected arson attack as part of a bid
OL,9,Fto raise funds for the authority.
OL,11,FA fire ripped through the building on
OL,12,FSt John's Road in Birkby, Huddersfield,
OL,13,Fin November, forcing the owners of two
OL,14,Flong-standing businesses to cease
OL,15,Ftrading at the location.
OL,17,FKirklees Council, which owns the
OL,18,Fbuilding, had previously planned to
OL,19,Fdemolish it but may sell it as part of
OL,20,Fa wider property sale.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
